{
  "comment": "Reproducible recipe of the Windows x64 Engine Pack (ADR-0013). Every input is downloaded from its upstream and checked against a pinned SHA-256; an input still pinned to null is checked against the SHA-256 its publisher lists next to it and the observed value must then be pinned here. Assembled by tools/engine_pack_release.py on a Windows runner (.github/workflows/engine-pack.yml).",
  "id": "acet-engines-win64",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "platform": "win-x64",
  "supported_acet": ">=0.1,<2.0",
